t), \\\"Top Rated\\\" (4.9→4.0 descending), \\\"Price: Low to High\\\" ($59.99→$2495) and \\\"Price: High to Low\\\" ($2495→$59.99) all produced correctly ordered grids. Min-rating filter \\\"4.5+ stars\\\" reduced 11→9 products (excluding 4.0 and 4.4 rated items). Price-range minimum slider raised to $160 combined with 4.5+ rating reduced to 8 (correctly excluding the $149.99 item too).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Newly created/edited products are not persisted; a page reload reverts the catalog to the original seed data\", \"actual\": \"After creating \\\"Test Gadget Pro Updated\\\" and \\\"FT5 Fitness Widget\\\" (verified present, 11 products total on /products), a full browser navigation/reload to another URL caused /products to revert to \\\"9 products found\\\" — the original seeded set only. Both admin-created/edited products were lost.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Admin product form exposes Category as a single required select (Tech Gadgets/Home Goods/Fitness) with no multi-select or none option; every product observed across categories/detail pages showed exactly one category label.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combining min-rating 4.5+ and price-min $160 correctly returned only 8 products (excluding a 4.6-rated $149.99 item and lower-rated items), showing AND across criteria. Selecting tags \\\"wireless\\\"+\\\"camera\\\" together returned 2 products (Sony WH-1000XM5 which has \\\"wireless\\\", Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra which has \\\"camera\\\"), confirming OR/at-least-one-tag logic across selected tags.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Products can be published/created without required content (image, retailer link, specification)\", \"actual\": \"Created a product with only Name and Short Description filled (left Image URL